# 10. Non-Functional Requirements

## Performance

* Analyze a typical smart contract project (<100 contracts) in under 10 minutes for the initial static review.
* Support at least 100 concurrent audit jobs through queued execution.
* Handle repositories containing more than 10,000 source files.

## Availability

* 99.9% uptime for the SaaS deployment.
* Resume interrupted analyses without data loss.
* Support horizontal scaling of analysis workers.

## Security

* End-to-end encryption for customer data.
* Role-based access control (RBAC).
* Multi-factor authentication (MFA).
* Comprehensive audit logging.
* Secrets stored in a dedicated vault.
* Tenant data isolation for SaaS deployments.

## Scalability

* Multi-tenant architecture.
* Pluggable analysis engines.
* Distributed job processing.
* Plugin framework for new blockchains and analysis tools.

## Usability

* No-code audit workflow for non-technical users.
* REST and GraphQL APIs for automation.
* CLI for developers.
* Rich web dashboard with drill-down capabilities.

